# postinstall

canonical instructions: `AGENTS.md` at the repo root. read it first.

minimum rules for any edit:

- target is debian 13 only. bash 5, systemd, apt. no build step, no ci.
- modules are idempotent, non-interactive, and mutate only through `run()`.
  config writes only through `write_file` (backup + compare first).
- new module: file, entrypoint `case`, config default, config example, README
  row, topic doc, audit check, changelog. all of them.
- never weaken the ssh key lockout guard or add password auth defaults.
- never commit tokens, keys or real addresses.
- gates: `bash -n`, `shellcheck -x`, `--list`, `--help`; full `--dry-run` only
  on a disposable debian 13 vm.
